@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #63527B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam classBorderColor #B3A3CB
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam componentBorderColor #B3A3CB
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam stateBorderColor #B3A3CB
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam activityBorderColor #B3A3CB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C4BBCF
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D9C69A
skinparam titleFontSize 22
hide empty members
title 栖物 · 竞争预约与请求重放
actor "买家 A / B" as Buyer
boundary "商品详情" as UI
control "reserve_product" as Service
database "SQLite" as DB
control "events.py" as Audit
Buyer -> UI : 提交预约
UI -> Service : 商品 ID、页面版本、request_key
Service -> DB : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
Service -> DB : 核对普通账号和已提交回执\n按发起人与 request_key 查询
alt 已有回执且请求摘要相同
  DB --> Service : 原预约 ID
  Service -> DB : 结束事务
  Service --> UI : 打开原预约
else 新请求且状态校验通过
  Service -> DB : 校验归属、当前状态与版本\n条件更新商品为已预约
  Service -> DB : 写预约、回执、通知和成功审计
  Service -> DB : COMMIT
  Service --> UI : 打开新预约
else 回执冲突、状态错误或写入失败
  Service -> DB : ROLLBACK
  Service -> Audit : 独立写失败审计
  Service --> UI : 显示冲突或可重试错误
end
note over Service, DB
  数据库保证每件商品最多一条有效预约
  请求摘要绑定商品 ID 与版本
end note

@enduml
